<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="tracera-diagram-gen" version="24.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="26-github-app-sync" name="GitHub App sync"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="frame" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1600" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="titlebar" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FF6B35;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="26" width="56" height="5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub App sync&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;fontSize=26;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="36" width="1520" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="Connect an installation once, pick repositories one by one, and every push brings the exact commit Tracera saw into the index." style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="74" width="1520" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a0" value="&lt;b&gt;1  Connect GitHub&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The owner opens the GitHub card on the Repositories page. Tracera sends the browser to the App's install page with a signed state: workspace, user, a nonce and a 10-minute expiry." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="125" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a1" value="&lt;b&gt;2  Install on GitHub&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;On GitHub the owner chooses the account and the repositories to share. GitHub returns to Tracera's callback with an installation ID and an OAuth code." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A89888;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="125" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="&lt;b&gt;3  Verify the callback&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The state is accepted only for the same signed-in owner and workspace. The OAuth code proves the GitHub user can reach that installation, and the App's permissions are checked before anything is listed." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="812" y="125" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a3" value="&lt;b&gt;4  Bind to the workspace&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The installation is bound to the workspace. Without the App's variables every GitHub endpoint answers capability_unavailable and the card names the unset variables." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1198" y="125" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b0" value="&lt;b&gt;5  Pick repositories&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The owner connects repositories one by one from the installation's list. It is an explicit selection: nothing is indexed by default." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="365" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b1" value="&lt;b&gt;6  A sync is triggered&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A connection, a push webhook, a reconciliation or the Sync button records a repository_updates row and queues repository.sync. A burst of pushes merges into one fetch and one index." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="365" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b2" value="&lt;b&gt;7  Fetch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The worker mints a short-lived installation token and runs git fetch over HTTPS into Tracera's bare cache. Tokens live in memory only: never in a URL, a log or a git config file." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A89888;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="812" y="365" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b3" value="&lt;b&gt;8  Index&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The exact commit the sync observed goes to the indexing service, or to patch impact for a pull request. The repository is then searchable and ready for investigations like a local one." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1198" y="365" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c0" value="&lt;b&gt;Webhooks are signals, not proof&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;X-Hub-Signature-256 is an HMAC-SHA256 over the raw body, compared in constant time. Deliveries are deduplicated by GUID, recorded as a content-free summary and processed idempotently. What gets indexed is always the head the sync observed." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="600" width="490" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="&lt;b&gt;Configuration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TRACERA_GITHUB_APP_ID, TRACERA_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH, TRACERA_GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET, TRACERA_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID and TRACERA_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET. The private key stays on the server. With any variable unset the feature is off and nothing else is affected." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="555" y="600" width="490" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Boundaries&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;GitHub endpoints are fixed constants and redirects are never followed. Connecting and syncing need an owner session, every query is scoped to the workspace, and GitHub calls and sync requests are rate limited per workspace." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="600" width="490" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s0" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t0" value="Web app, API or worker step" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82" y="860" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A89888;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="309" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t1" value="GitHub" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="351" y="860" width="54" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="427" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t2" value="Server decision" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="469" y="860" width="118" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="609" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t3" value="Notes" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="651" y="860" width="46" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t4" value="Next" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="765" y="860" width="39" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a0" target="a1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a1" target="a2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a2" target="a3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a3" target="b0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1360" y="335"/><mxPoint x="220" y="335"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b0" target="b1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b1" target="b2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b2" target="b3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="719" y="871" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="757" y="871" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
